{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268OvOzJ8RBJ1795063520.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人黃瑋傑表示，科網股陸續公布業績，將左右大市走勢，恒指不排除下試22,500點水平。</p><p></p><p>輝立證券董事黃瑋傑指出：「騰訊公布業績後股價承壓，所以恒指大幅低開，23,000點失守後，下一個低位看近期22,800點，但這位置我想也不太守得住。最重要、最關鍵支持位，就是之前年中時低位22,518點。本周重磅科網平台股公布業績，之前已有百度、京東及騰訊，接下來要看業績。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:58.914327+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T04:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.033243+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:16.935011+00:00","content_hash":"ddf9e527d61d05f47f9703a740ca46eafedef5c8c66db53102edef654881feeb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:58.914327+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}